%%MIDI program 43
% bars 1-4: [1] Motto: three repeated notes and a leap, full orchestra with piano
% bars 5-8: [2] A rocking figure for oboes over horns and bassoons, in three-four
% bars 9-12: [3] The motto again, dry: violins over detached chords
% bars 13-20: [4] Two-four: a trumpet fanfare over hammering strings
% bars 21-28: [5] A song for the clarinet in D over held strings
% bars 29-32: [6] Syncopated chords for everyone close the first part
% bars 33-40: [7] Middle: the fanfare suddenly a third higher, in B flat
% bars 41-44: [8] The rocking figure in E flat, for clarinets
% bars 45-52: [fug] The motto as a short fugato: violins, violas, then cellos and basses
% bars 53-56: [9] Four bars of hammered dominant chords with holes in them
% bars 57-60: [10] The motto returns
% bars 61-64: [11] A rocking figure for oboes over horns and bassoons, in three-four
% bars 65-68: [12] The motto again, dry: violins over detached chords
% bars 69-76: [13] Two-four: a trumpet fanfare over hammering strings
% bars 77-84: [14] The clarinet’s song in G, now for flute
% bars 85-88: [15] The syncopated chords in G
